<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0b0c" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Painel" />
    <title>Painel · introducing.news</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style is:inline>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --bg: #f9f9fb;
        --card: #ffffff;
        --fg: #0b0b0c;
        --fg-2: #4b4b55;
        --muted: #6b6b76;
        --border: #e4e4e9;
        --grid: #ececf0;
        --accent: #e06c0f;
        --accent-soft: #fff6ed;
        --series-in: #e06c0f;
        --series-out: #2a78d6;
        --series-visits: #6b6b76;
        --good: #1f7a3d;
        --bad: #b42318;
        --hl: rgba(11, 11, 12, 0.06);
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          color-scheme: dark;
          --bg: #0b0b0c;
          --card: #141417;
          --fg: #f2f2f5;
          --fg-2: #c9c9d1;
          --muted: #9a9aa4;
          --border: #26262b;
          --grid: #222227;
          --accent: #f6821f;
          --accent-soft: #2a1a0c;
          --series-in: #d95926;
          --series-out: #3987e5;
          --series-visits: #8e8e99;
          --good: #5cc77f;
          --bad: #f97066;
          --hl: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
        }
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--fg);
        font: 15px/1.45 'Geist', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) 0 env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
      }
      .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 16px 48px; }
      header { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .brand { font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
      .brand span { color: var(--accent); }
      .periods { display: inline-flex; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px; }
      .periods a { padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--fg-2); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
      .periods a[aria-current='page'] { background: var(--fg); color: var(--card); }
      .meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); width: 100%; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
      .meta a { color: var(--fg-2); }
      .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      h2 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--fg-2); margin: 0 0 4px; }
      .sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 12px; }
      .hero-value { font-size: 52px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; }
      .hero-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      @media (min-width: 620px) { .tiles { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
      .tile { margin: 0; }
      .tile .value { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; }
      .delta { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--muted); }
      .delta.good { color: var(--good); }
      .delta.bad { color: var(--bad); }
      .delta.good::before { content: '▲ '; }
      .delta.bad::before { content: '▼ '; }
      svg.chart { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; overflow: visible; touch-action: pan-y; }
      .chart text { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 9px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
      .chart .grid { stroke: var(--grid); stroke-width: 1; }
      .chart .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
      .chart .in { fill: var(--series-in); }
      .chart .out { fill: var(--series-out); }
      .chart .visits { fill: var(--series-visits); }
      .chart .hit { fill: transparent; cursor: pointer; }
      .chart .hit.on { fill: var(--hl); }
      .legend { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-2); margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .legend i { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 6px; vertical-align: -1px; }
      .readout { min-height: 40px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-2); background: var(--bg); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; margin-top: 8px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
      .readout strong { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 600; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
      th, td { padding: 7px 6px; text-align: right; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); white-space: nowrap; }
      th:first-child, td:first-child { text-align: left; }
      th { font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
      td.slug { max-width: 150px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
      .scroll { overflow-x: auto; margin: 0 -16px; padding: 0 16px; }
      details summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-2); margin-top: 10px; }
      .bars { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
      .bars li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 4px 10px; font-size: 13px; }
      .bars .name { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
      .bars .count { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--fg-2); }
      .bars .track { grid-column: 1 / -1; height: 6px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 3px; }
      .bars .fill { height: 6px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 3px; min-width: 3px; }
      .split { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
      @media (min-width: 620px) { .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .split .card { margin-bottom: 0; } .split { margin-bottom: 12px; } }
      .empty { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
      .error { border-color: var(--bad); color: var(--bad); }
      .notes { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 20px; }
      .notes li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
      .mini { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      @media (min-width: 620px) { .mini { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
      .mini .label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
      .mini .v { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <header>
        <div class="brand">introducing<span>.</span>news · painel</div>
        <nav class="periods" aria-label="Período">
          {PERIODS.map((p) => (
            <a href={`?p=${p}`} aria-current={p === period ? 'page' : undefined}>{p} dias</a>
          ))}
        </nav>
        {data && (
          <div class="meta">
            <span>Resend lido {ago(data.snapshot.fetchedAt)}</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <a href={`?p=${period}&atualizar`}>atualizar</a>
          </div>
        )}
      </header>

      {failure && <div class="card error">{failure}</div>}

      {data && t && prev && flow && visits && (
        <>
          <section class="card" aria-labelledby="ativos">
            <h2 id="ativos">Assinantes ativos</h2>
            <div class="hero-row">
              <div class="hero-value">{int.format(data.snapshot.active)}</div>
              <div class={`delta ${t.net > 0 ? 'good' : t.net < 0 ? 'bad' : ''}`}>
                {signed(t.net)} nos últimos {period} dias
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="sub" style="margin:6px 0 0">
              {int.format(data.snapshot.total)} contatos no total · {int.format(data.snapshot.unsubscribed)} descadastrados
            </p>
          </section>

          <div class="tiles">
            {[
              { label: 'Novas inscrições', value: int.format(t.signups), d: delta(t.signups, prev.signups) },
              { label: 'Descadastros', value: int.format(t.unsubscribes), d: delta(t.unsubscribes, prev.unsubscribes, false) },
              { label: 'Taxa de churn', value: pct(t.churn, 2), d: delta(t.churn, prev.churn, false, true) },
              { label: 'Conversão (inscrições ÷ visitas)', value: pct(t.conversion, 2), d: delta(t.conversion, prev.conversion, true, true) },
              { label: 'Visitas', value: int.format(t.visits), d: delta(t.visits, prev.visits) },
              { label: 'Páginas vistas', value: int.format(t.views), d: delta(t.views, prev.views) },
            ].map((tile) => (
              <div class="card tile">
                <h2>{tile.label}</h2>
                <div class="value">{tile.value}</div>
                {tile.d && <div class={`delta ${tile.d.tone}`}>{tile.d.text}</div>}
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <section class="card" aria-labelledby="fluxo">
            <h2 id="fluxo">Inscrições e descadastros por dia</h2>
            <div class="legend">
              <span><i style="background:var(--series-in)"></i>Inscrições</span>
              <span><i style="background:var(--series-out)"></i>Descadastros</span>
            </div>
            <svg class="chart" data-chart viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${flow.H}`} role="img" aria-label="Colunas de inscrições (acima) e descadastros (abaixo) por dia">
              {flow.ticks.map((tick) => (
                <>
                  <line class={tick.label === '0' ? 'axis' : 'grid'} x1={PAD.left} x2={W - PAD.right} y1={tick.y} y2={tick.y} />
                  <text x={PAD.left - 6} y={tick.y + 3} text-anchor="end">{tick.label}</text>
                </>
              ))}
              {flow.bars.map((bar) => (
                <>
                  <rect class="hit" x={bar.hitX} y={PAD.top} width={flow.slot} height={flow.H - PAD.top - PAD.bottom} data-row={rowJson(bar.row)} />
                  {bar.up && <path class="in" d={bar.up} pointer-events="none" />}
                  {bar.down && <path class="out" d={bar.down} pointer-events="none" />}
                </>
              ))}
              {ticksX.map((tick) => (
                <text x={tick.x} y={flow.H - 4} text-anchor={tick.anchor}>{tick.label}</text>
              ))}
            </svg>
            <div class="readout" data-readout aria-live="polite">Toque em um dia para ver os números.</div>
          </section>

          <section class="card" aria-labelledby="visitas">
            <h2 id="visitas">Visitas por dia</h2>
            <p class="sub">
              Entradas no site (referrer externo ou direto), sem cookie.
              {data.trackedSince ? ` Medido desde ${dayLabel(data.trackedSince, 'long')}.` : ' Ainda sem visitas medidas.'}
            </p>
            <svg class="chart" data-chart viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${visits.H}`} role="img" aria-label="Colunas de visitas por dia">
              {visits.ticks.map((tick) => (
                <>
                  <line class={tick.label === '0' ? 'axis' : 'grid'} x1={PAD.left} x2={W - PAD.right} y1={tick.y} y2={tick.y} />
                  <text x={PAD.left - 6} y={tick.y + 3} text-anchor="end">{tick.label}</text>
                </>
              ))}
              {visits.bars.map((bar) => (
                <>
                  <rect class="hit" x={bar.hitX} y={PAD.top} width={visits.slot} height={visits.H - PAD.top - PAD.bottom} data-row={rowJson(bar.row)} />
                  {bar.path && <path class="visits" d={bar.path} pointer-events="none" />}
                </>
              ))}
              {ticksX.map((tick) => (
                <text x={tick.x} y={visits.H - 4} text-anchor={tick.anchor}>{tick.label}</text>
              ))}
            </svg>
            <div class="readout" data-readout aria-live="polite">Toque em um dia para ver os números.</div>
            <details>
              <summary>Ver tabela por dia</summary>
              <div class="scroll">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr><th>Dia</th><th>Visitas</th><th>Inscrições</th><th>Reinscr.</th><th>Descad.</th><th>Conversão</th></tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    {[...data.rows].reverse().map((row) => (
                      <tr>
                        <td>{dayLabel(row.day, 'long')}</td>
                        <td>{int.format(row.visits)}</td>
                        <td>{int.format(row.signups)}</td>
                        <td>{int.format(row.resubscribes)}</td>
                        <td>{int.format(row.unsubscribes)}</td>
                        <td>{row.visits > 0 ? pct(row.signups / row.visits) : '—'}</td>
                      </tr>
                    ))}
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </details>
          </section>

          <div class="split">
            {[
              { id: 'origem-inscricoes', title: 'Origem das inscrições', list: data.signupSources },
              { id: 'origem-visitas', title: 'Origem das visitas', list: data.sources },
            ].map((block) => (
              <section class="card" aria-labelledby={block.id}>
                <h2 id={block.id}>{block.title}</h2>
                <p class="sub">utm_source ou site de origem, últimos {period} dias</p>
                {block.list.length ? (
                  <ul class="bars">
                    {block.list.map((item) => (
                      <li>
                        <span class="name">{item.name}</span>
                        <span class="count">{int.format(item.count)}</span>
                        <span class="track"><span class="fill" style={`display:block;width:${(item.count / maxSource(block.list)) * 100}%`}></span></span>
                      </li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                ) : (
                  <p class="empty">Sem dados no período.</p>
                )}
              </section>
            ))}
          </div>

          <section class="card" aria-labelledby="ultima">
            <h2 id="ultima">Última edição enviada</h2>
            {latest ? (
              <>
                <p class="sub">{latest.slug} · {latest.sentAt ? dayLabel(latest.sentAt.slice(0, 10), 'long') : ''} · {int.format(latest.delivered)} entregues</p>
                <div class="mini">
                  <div><div class="label">Abertura</div><div class="v">{pct(rate(latest.opened, latest.delivered))}</div></div>
                  <div><div class="label">Clique (CTR)</div><div class="v">{pct(rate(latest.clicked, latest.delivered))}</div></div>
                  <div><div class="label">Clique ÷ abertura</div><div class="v">{pct(rate(latest.clicked, latest.opened))}</div></div>
                  <div><div class="label">Bounces</div><div class="v">{pct(rate(latest.bounced, latest.sent))}</div></div>
                </div>
                {data.snapshot.topLinks.length > 0 && (
                  <ul class="bars">
                    {data.snapshot.topLinks.map((link) => (
                      <li>
                        <span class="name" title={link.url}>{shortUrl(link.url)}</span>
                        <span class="count">{int.format(link.unique)} únicos</span>
                        <span class="track"><span class="fill" style={`display:block;width:${(link.unique / Math.max(...data!.snapshot.topLinks.map((l) => l.unique), 1)) * 100}%`}></span></span>
                      </li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                )}
              </>
            ) : (
              <p class="empty">Nenhuma edição enviada ainda.</p>
            )}
          </section>

          {data.snapshot.editions.length > 0 && (
            <section class="card" aria-labelledby="edicoes">
              <h2 id="edicoes">Todas as edições</h2>
              <div class="scroll">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr><th>Edição</th><th>Entregues</th><th>Abertura</th><th>Clique</th><th>Descad.</th><th>Reclam.</th></tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    {data.snapshot.editions.map((edition) => (
                      <tr>
                        <td class="slug" title={edition.slug}>{edition.slug}</td>
                        <td>{int.format(edition.delivered)}</td>
                        <td>{pct(rate(edition.opened, edition.delivered))}</td>
                        <td>{pct(rate(edition.clicked, edition.delivered))}</td>
                        <td>{int.format(edition.unsubscribed)}</td>
                        <td>{int.format(edition.complained)}</td>
                      </tr>
                    ))}
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </section>
          )}

          <ul class="notes">
            <li>Inscrições vêm do Resend (data de criação do contato); reinscrições e descadastros pela página são contados a partir da ativação do painel.</li>
            <li>Churn = descadastros do período ÷ ativos no início do período. Conversão considera só os dias com visitas medidas.</li>
            <li>Abertura é inflada pelo Apple Mail Privacy Protection — prefira o clique.</li>
          </ul>
        </>
      )}
    </div>

    <script is:inline>
      (function () {
        var charts = document.querySelectorAll('[data-chart]');
        charts.forEach(function (svg) {
          var readout = svg.parentElement.querySelector('[data-readout]');
          var current = null;
          function show(hit) {
            if (current) current.classList.remove('on');
            current = hit;
            hit.classList.add('on');
            var r = JSON.parse(hit.getAttribute('data-row'));
            readout.innerHTML = '';
            var day = document.createElement('strong');
            day.textContent = r.d;
            readout.appendChild(day);
            readout.appendChild(document.createElement('br'));
            readout.appendChild(
              document.createTextNode(
                r.s + ' inscrições' + (r.r ? ' (+' + r.r + ' reinscr.)' : '') + ' · ' + r.u + ' descad. · ' + r.v + ' visitas · conversão ' + r.c,
              ),
            );
          }
          svg.addEventListener('pointerdown', function (event) {
            if (event.target.classList && event.target.classList.contains('hit')) show(event.target);
          });
          svg.addEventListener('pointermove', function (event) {
            if (event.pointerType === 'mouse' && event.target.classList && event.target.classList.contains('hit')) show(event.target);
          });
        });
      })();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
